      "source": "memory",
      "snippet": "- OpenClaw boot sequence requirements in this workspace: read BOOTSTRAP.md first if present, then BOOT.md and its ordered startup files; REGLAS.md must be read in small sequential chunks. User-facing bootstrap greeting should be 1–3 sentences, in persona, asking what to do next, without mentioning internal files/tools/steps. - boot-md root cause and local fix applied in installed OpenClaw bundle under `/home/luispicone/.npm-global/lib/node_modules/openclaw/dist/bundled/boot-md/`: `HOOK.md` now registers `gateway:startup`, `command:new`, and `command:reset`; `handler.js` uses an inline command-event check for new/reset; boot runs must stay isolated and must not reuse the triggering session ke",
